{"path":"biology/mnemonics","title":"生物口诀卡","type":"mnemonic","html":"<h3>口诀一：有丝分裂四时期</h3>\n<p>&quot;<strong>膜仁消失现两体，形数清晰赤道齐；点裂数增均两极，膜仁重现失两体。</strong>&quot;</p>\n<p>（前期：核膜核仁消失、染色体纺锤体出现；中期：着丝点排列赤道板、数目形态最清晰；后期：着丝点分裂、染色体数加倍、移向两极；末期：核膜核仁重现、染色体纺锤体消失。）</p>\n<h3>口诀二：光合作用</h3>\n<p>&quot;<strong>水光解、碳固定、C₃还原、五碳再生。</strong>&quot;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>光反应：水的光解（产 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[H]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>）、ATP 合成；</li>\n<li>暗反应：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 固定（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_5\\to C_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）、<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 还原（需 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[H]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span> 和 ATP，产 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和糖类）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>口诀三：遗传系谱图</h3>\n<p>&quot;<strong>无中生有为隐性，有中生无为显性；隐性遗传看女病，父子患病伴 X 隐；显性遗传看男病，母女患病伴 X 显。</strong>&quot;</p>\n<h3>口诀四：9331 变式</h3>\n<p>&quot;<strong>16 份两对基因，拆成 3:1 乘 3:1；9:7 互补，9:3:4 合并，15:1 有显即同。</strong>&quot;</p>\n<h3>口诀五：免疫细胞</h3>\n<p>&quot;<strong>B 产抗体浆细胞，T 管细胞效应 T；吞噬细胞能吃能递，记忆细胞又快又强。</strong>&quot;</p>\n<p>（浆细胞分泌抗体；效应 T 细胞接触靶细胞；吞噬细胞吞噬并呈递抗原；二次免疫由记忆细胞快速应答。）</p>\n<h3>口诀六：内环境成分</h3>\n<p>&quot;<strong>蛋白糖脂水无机盐，激素抗体尿素全；血红蛋白呼吸酶，细胞内部不露面。</strong>&quot;</p>\n<p>（内环境成分：蛋白质、葡萄糖、<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、激素、抗体、尿素等；血红蛋白、呼吸酶、消化酶在细胞内或消化道，不属于内环境。）</p>\n<h3>口诀七：减数分裂</h3>\n<p>&quot;<strong>同源联会四分体，交叉互换在前期；同源分离减一后，姐妹分开减二里。</strong>&quot;</p>\n<p>（减Ⅰ前期联会、交叉互换；减Ⅰ后期同源染色体分离；减Ⅱ后期姐妹染色单体分离。）</p>\n<h3>口诀八：育种</h3>\n<p>&quot;<strong>杂交育种时间长，诱变突变不定向；单倍体快花药养，秋水仙素翻一番。</strong>&quot;</p>\n","standardHtml":null,"evilHtml":null,"meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":["口诀","有丝分裂","光合作用","遗传","免疫"],"summary":"口诀一：有丝分裂四时期 &quot; 膜仁消失现两体，形数清晰赤道齐；点裂数增均两极，膜仁重现失两体。 &quot; （前期：核膜核仁消失、染色体纺锤体出现；中期：着丝点排列赤道板、数目形态最清晰；后期：着丝点分裂、染色体数加倍、移向两极；","fit":[],"updated":"Wed Feb 05 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"biology","title":"生物"},{"slug":"mnemonics","title":"生物口诀卡"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"biotech","title":"生物技术与工程","type":"category"},{"slug":"cells","title":"分子与细胞","type":"category"},{"slug":"concept-pitfalls","title":"概念辨析·选择题易错点合集","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"ecology","title":"生物与环境","type":"category"},{"slug":"essay-templates","title":"生物大题答题句式模板","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"experiments","title":"实验与探究","type":"category"},{"slug":"genetics","title":"遗传与进化","type":"category"},{"slug":"homeostasis","title":"稳态与调节","type":"category"},{"slug":"methods","title":"生物方法专题","type":"category"}]}